                    EL PASO ELECTRIC COMPANY AND
            NEW MEXICO STATE UNIVERSITY’S JOINT EXPLANATION

       El Paso Electric Company (“EPE”), together with the Regents of New Mexico State

University (“NMSU”), file the following explanation pursuant to the Hearing Examiners’ Order

Granting Motion to Withdraw Confidential Testimony and Refile Testimony issued on November

18, 2026.


       1.     NMSU filed a Motion to Withdraw Confidential Testimony and File Amended

Public Testimony of Michael P. Gorman on Behalf of the Regents of the New Mexico State

University on October 28, 2026 ("NMSU's Motion").

       2.     In that Motion, NMSU stated that it requested that it be allowed to withdraw the

Confidential Testimony of Michael P. Gorman and its Confidential Exhibit MPG-21, and to file an

amended version of the public Testimony of Michael P. Gorman that was filed on October 23, 2026

on behalf of NMSU. Motion at 1.

       3.     NMSU did not request to refile CONFIDENTIAL MPG-21 as a public, unredacted

exhibit. NMSU does not wish to refile CONFIDENTIAL MPG-21.

       4.     “NMSU no longer intends to use the additional confidential material designated as

Confidential Exhibit MPG-21 in pre-filed testimony or at the hearing in this matter.” El Paso

Electric Company and New Mexico State University’s Joint Stipulated Resolution to NMSU’s
 Notice of Intent to Use Material Designated as Confidential (Oct. 28, 2026) ("Joint Stipulated

Resolution") at ¶ 5.

       5.      It was not NMSU’s intention to file any version of CONFIDENTIAL Exhibit MPG-

21 with the public testimony of NMSU witness Michael P. Gorman.

       6.      NMSU will file an amended public version of the Direct Testimony of Michael P.

Gorman, unredacting the redacted portions of pages 22, 25, and 27.

       7.      The remainder of the stipulations articulated in the Joint Stipulated Resolution and

the statements in NMSU’s Motion remain in place.

       8.      Accordingly, NMSU shall file an amended, unredacted version of the Public Direct

Testimony and Exhibits of Michael P. Gorman without CONFIDENTIAL Exhibit MPG-21.

